\item[S2] Afonso S. Bandeira, Christopher Kennedy and Amit Singer, Approximating the Little Grothendieck Problem over the Orthogonal and Unitary Groups (2013; revised 2016), arXiv:1308.5207, Definition 2 and Conjecture 8. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/1308.5207}.
